WEBVTT

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:22.250
Oh, Nanako!

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.750
No club meeting today?

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:26.960
That so?

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:29.460
Speaking of which...

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:34.430
Since it's summer break,
you ought to have your friends over.

00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:38.420
Like... this thug friend of 
yours. I'd love to meet him.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.380
I've been Nanako's father for 15 years now...

00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:53.460
In all that time, I've seen her go
through all sorts of emotions.

00:00:56.250 --> 00:01:01.750
I've seen her laugh, cry, get angry...
Each a precious moment in its own way.

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:03.670
But...

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:09.170
THIS IS THE FIRST TIME 
I'VE EVER SEEN THAT LOOK!

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:15.960
Gentle words

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:19.080
Soft feelings

00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:24.000
Precious memories

00:01:28.130 --> 00:01:30.580
They're dyed with love

00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:36.790
When I'm with you, even getting caught
in the rain turns into something new

00:01:36.960 --> 00:01:40.000
What words can I string together

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:43.170
To keep this color from fading away?

00:01:43.170 --> 00:01:44.750
I know

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:50.670
What the two of us will 
become on that far-off day

00:01:52.830 --> 00:01:56.080
Isn't that right, God?

00:01:56.250 --> 00:01:59.580
Waiting for the train, the 
water droplets beading up

00:01:59.580 --> 00:02:02.170
I really wish this moment

00:02:02.170 --> 00:02:07.170
Could somehow last forever

00:02:07.170 --> 00:02:09.210
Is that too much to ask?

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:17.500
Poem 9:
Eiji and Nanako's Dad

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:29.920
Stickin' with the whole school uniform thing
during the summer sure is tough...

00:02:31.880 --> 00:02:33.000
It's from Nanako...

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:34.900
"Good morning, Ei-chan!

00:02:34.900 --> 00:02:36.090
Got any plans for today?

00:02:36.090 --> 00:02:37.130
How busy are you?"

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:38.380
Let's see- Shoot!

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:46.330
I dropped my phone in my crappy lunch
and now the screen looks all weird!

00:02:47.580 --> 00:02:50.290
I-is your big brother okay...?

00:02:50.880 --> 00:02:54.380
He gets all quiet when something
REALLY bad happens, so he's fine!

00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:58.750
Oh, I see. Water damage, huh?

00:02:58.750 --> 00:02:59.710
Yup.

00:03:00.080 --> 00:03:02.460
Were you able to restore your backup data?

00:03:02.790 --> 00:03:05.750
I've never needed backup in my life.

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:06.330
BACKUP

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:08.580
I-is that so...?

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:09.830
Never lost a fight.

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:13.460
If you don't mind, where 
exactly did you drop it?

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:15.630
Oh! Um...

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:19.170
Salt...? Or was it miso...?

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:21.830
It doesn't matter what flavor the ramen was!

00:03:23.130 --> 00:03:25.690
It's gonna take 'em a whole day to fix it...

00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:30.000
KARAI SHOPPING CENTER

00:03:25.690 --> 00:03:30.000
Treasure Trove Shopping Center

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:30.000
Oh well. I'm already out...
Guess I'll take a look around.

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:30.000
Where you're sure to find a hidden gem!

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:33.080
Free tissues!

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:35.580
Please, have some free tissues!

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:38.750
Big Sis Koto. What're you doing?

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:39.960
Oh, Eiji!

00:03:42.460 --> 00:03:44.630
I got a job handing out tissue packets.

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:47.960
Here you go! You can have one, too.

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:50.000
Thanks.

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:53.760
Double them up and they won't rip as easily.

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:55.550
Keep that in mind when you use them, 'kay?

00:03:56.290 --> 00:03:57.880
I have no idea what you're talking about.

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:06.170
It's the president!

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:09.960
Studying in a café?

00:04:09.960 --> 00:04:13.880
Wow... She seems way more 
sophisticated than usual.

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:16.670
Oh, she's waving the waiter down.

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:19.420
Looks like they didn't notice her...

00:04:19.790 --> 00:04:22.750
She's pretending like she 
was just stretching?!

00:04:22.750 --> 00:04:24.880
Yeah, THERE'S the president I know!

00:04:25.670 --> 00:04:27.750
I'm gettin' kinda hungry...

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:29.250
I could go for a beef bowl.

00:04:31.710 --> 00:04:33.420
Take your time and enjoy!

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:35.920
Huh? Tao...?

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:44.090
I don't need tarot cards to 
know what you're thinking...

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:48.140
"What a pitiful girl, going out to eat all
by herself during summer break."

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:49.810
That's what you thought, right?!

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:51.580
I wasn't thinking anything like that!

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:54.700
"Normally she dresses all 
cute like a Gothic Lolita!

00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:57.100
Does she really wear plain old 
T-shirts on her days off?!"

00:04:57.270 --> 00:04:59.000
Is that about right?!

00:05:00.420 --> 00:05:02.210
...I mighta thought that one, sorry.

00:05:08.210 --> 00:05:10.290
Oh, the president's still there.

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:13.830
Whoa, she's drinking black coffee!

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:15.670
I guess she's pretty mature after all.

00:05:15.670 --> 00:05:16.580
Hot!

00:05:17.130 --> 00:05:19.790
She burned her mouth! And 
she yelled really loud!

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:25.800
O-ho-ho! She's making it look like she's on the phone!
That's some quick thinking!

00:05:29.380 --> 00:05:30.080
HOT!

00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:31.500
She did it again!

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:41.540
Kino's sketching something.

00:05:42.130 --> 00:05:45.830
Wow... I guess "observing the subject"
really is important.

00:05:47.630 --> 00:05:48.580
Yo, Kino!

00:05:51.710 --> 00:05:55.200
These ol' things haven't 
changed since I was a kid...

00:05:58.250 --> 00:05:59.080
Lemme see.

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:00.500
Wha-?!

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:01.920
THAT'S what you drew?!

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:02.420
Detective Gorilla

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:04.420
Why were you so focused on the mailbox?!

00:06:04.080 --> 00:06:06.170
Whoopsie-daisy!

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:05.380
Whoopsie-daisy!

00:06:07.580 --> 00:06:10.500
Man, I keep runnin' into people
all over the place today...

00:06:10.960 --> 00:06:13.080
In fact, I think that was 
pretty much everyone.

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:18.080
Everyone except for Nanako, that is...

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:21.380
Well, it doesn't really matter.

00:06:22.210 --> 00:06:25.080
Fact is, I kinda ignored her text...

00:06:36.130 --> 00:06:38.130
I wonder what she's doing right now...

00:06:38.670 --> 00:06:41.130
I can't go thinkin' such lame crap!

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:45.460
If someone heard me barin' my soul
like that, I'd die of embarrassment!

00:06:46.960 --> 00:06:48.550
I can't see!

00:06:48.550 --> 00:06:50.370
Tryin' to blind me?! Sneaky bastards!

00:06:50.370 --> 00:06:52.640
That's a dirty trick, you-!

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:01.690
Oh! It's you, Ei-chan!

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:03.040
I'm surprised to see you here!

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:04.230
What are you up to?

00:07:05.540 --> 00:07:06.920
Oh, Nanako!

00:07:06.920 --> 00:07:08.210
I was just thinkin' how much I missed-

00:07:09.250 --> 00:07:13.080
Uh, no! That's... not what I meant!

00:07:13.080 --> 00:07:17.250
You see, I... I ran into the president
and a bunch of the others today!

00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:21.370
So, I was thinkin' I just needed to see you
for my day to be complete, so to speak...

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:24.290
Oh, I get it now!

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:25.830
So, what exactly was it

00:07:25.830 --> 00:07:26.830
You wanted to say?

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:32.460
Well, um... I-I just meant that
I'm so used to seein' you, you know?

00:07:34.420 --> 00:07:36.580
S-so, with that in mind...

00:07:38.170 --> 00:07:39.170
I missed you.

00:07:40.330 --> 00:07:42.460
I was just thinkin' I wanted to see you.

00:07:46.830 --> 00:07:48.210
Oh wow, I was too!

00:07:48.210 --> 00:07:49.610
What a huge coincidence!

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:50.780
I can't believe it!

00:07:52.170 --> 00:07:54.630
Did you run into everyone 
else or somethin', too?

00:07:56.420 --> 00:07:57.900
Hey, listen, Ei-chan...

00:07:57.900 --> 00:07:59.290
Would you want to come hang out

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:00.460
At my place today?

00:08:00.460 --> 00:08:01.290
Huh?

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:04.170
Your old man wants to meet ME?!

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:08.380
It's nice to meet you! I'm Eiji Busujima!

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:11.080
Thank you very much for having 
me in your lovely home!

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:14.590
Welcome! So YOU'RE the famous Eiji-kun.

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:16.540
Please make yourself at home.

00:08:18.170 --> 00:08:22.170
You're Busujima-kun, yes? Come, have a seat.

00:08:22.170 --> 00:08:24.250
Y-yessir! Thank you, sir!

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:32.640
Well then, Busujima-kun. Let 
me ask you a question...

00:08:32.640 --> 00:08:36.460
You see... I'd like to know 
what sort of relation-

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:40.420
...what sort of relationship 
you have with Nanako.

00:08:40.420 --> 00:08:42.010
Relationship...?

00:08:42.550 --> 00:08:45.400
Should I just tell him
we're usually in the same class...?

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:48.630
Class C

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:48.290
Um, usually it's C...

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:51.380
"C," huh... "C"?!

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:54.290
NOTE: "A, B, C, and D" can also refer to the different levels
of physical contact in a sexual relationship.

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:54.290
YOU'VE GONE TO "C"?!

00:08:55.210 --> 00:08:56.710
WHY, YOU...!

00:08:56.710 --> 00:08:58.140
WHAT DID I DO WRONG?!

00:08:58.140 --> 00:09:00.850
YOU BASTARD! I'LL-!

00:08:58.630 --> 00:09:00.850
Calm down! What's going on here?!

00:09:02.920 --> 00:09:04.000
My apologies.

00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:06.500
I lost my cool for a moment there...

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:09.790
I should be the one to 
apologize. Totally my bad...

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:12.130
I didn't realize it could mean that.

00:09:13.920 --> 00:09:16.750
Going back to what I was 
saying, you're Nanako's...

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:18.750
You're JUST friends, correct?

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:21.250
Y-yessir! That's right!

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:24.960
And you're happy with that, right, Nanako?

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:25.750
Nana-

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:31.970
Your ol' dad might need to 
lie down for a minute...

00:09:31.970 --> 00:09:35.330
Mom! Dad's doing it again!

00:09:35.330 --> 00:09:39.040
Huh?! Does he do this a lot?! Is he okay?!

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:41.580
Come with us, Papa.

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:42.750
C'mon, Dad. Pull yourself together!

00:09:41.580 --> 00:09:43.430
We'll get you tucked into bed.

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:44.580
Just take it easy.

00:09:44.580 --> 00:09:47.000
I'm sorry for all the fuss.

00:09:47.460 --> 00:09:49.040
It's no big deal.

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:51.920
But I suppose there's a 
reason why he's like that.

00:09:52.380 --> 00:09:53.290
A reason...?

00:09:53.670 --> 00:09:57.830
I'm sure you're aware by now that Nanako only
communicates through senryu.

00:09:58.330 --> 00:10:02.740
She was bullied quite a bit
in elementary school because of it.

00:10:03.420 --> 00:10:07.170
From then on, she would hole up in
her room and hardly ever come out.

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:10.670
It really worried her father...

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:13.590
But then, the winter of her 
third year in middle school,

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:15.590
she met someone else who liked senryu

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:17.920
and came back absolutely glowing!

00:10:17.920 --> 00:10:21.100
This person must've said something 
to cheer her up, but...

00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:23.080
I wonder who it could've been...?

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:25.100
Y-yeah...

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:30.880
D-did Nanako happen to say anything
in particular about them...?

00:10:32.290 --> 00:10:36.830
She said it was the first time she'd
ever met someone outside of family

00:10:36.830 --> 00:10:38.750
that she'd always want to have by her side.

00:10:39.420 --> 00:10:41.960
Wow... G-gotcha...

00:10:41.960 --> 00:10:44.080
D-definitely wasn't me, though...

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:48.790
Whoops! I gotta go pick up my phone!
I'll be going now!

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:51.210
Oh? Come visit us again soon!

00:11:02.710 --> 00:11:08.130
It's almost funny how different we are

00:11:08.290 --> 00:11:13.500
Down to our reflections in the shop window

00:11:13.670 --> 00:11:19.170
When you smile as brightly as the sun

00:11:19.170 --> 00:11:27.710
A peaceful feeling washes over me

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:34.920
Even my trivial, everyday life

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:40.500
Begins to shine when I'm with you

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:43.960
Even if something happened

00:11:43.960 --> 00:11:47.130
Even if we hurt each other sometimes

00:11:47.130 --> 00:11:54.460
Believe in our ordinary days

00:11:57.790 --> 00:11:59.120
On the next epi-

00:11:59.120 --> 00:12:00.360
-sode of Senryu Girl:

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:01.430
Nanako, Fire-

00:12:01.430 --> 00:12:03.170
-flies, and a Test of Courage!

00:12:04.670 --> 00:12:06.540
Next Time, Poem 10
"Nanako, Fireflies, and a Test of Courage"
